[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "[Gabby gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "♪ Take us to the Dollhouse ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "♪ Little by little"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Let's live in the meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "-♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "-♪ What's the big surprise? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "♪ Let's shrink right down and go inside ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "I'm so glad you're here."
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Guess what today is."
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "It's my birthday!"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "Do you like my special birthday outfit?"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "[laughing] I'm ready to party."
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "-[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "-Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "[Floyd purring]"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "And it looks like"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "Floyd's ready to party too. Aww!"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "text": "And he has a present"
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "text": "he can't wait for us to open."
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "text": "Do you want to open it with me?"
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "text": "Let's see what it is."
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "text": "[gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "text": "It's a picture of me and Floyd."
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "text": "Oh, and I love the frame."
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "text": "Did you make this yourself, Floyd?"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "text": "He's so talented."
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "text": "Thank you, Floydy. I love it."
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "text": "And I'm gonna put it right here,"
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "text": "so we can see it every morning"
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "text": "when we wake up."
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "text": "-Ooh! You know what that sound means."
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "text": "It's time for a Dollhouse Delivery."
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "text": "Come on."
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "text": "Hey, Pandy. Paw bump?"
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "text": "[mimics explosion, chuckles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "text": "I wonder what our Meow Meow Mailbox"
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "text": "has for us today."
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "text": "[gasps] Hey!"
  },
  {
    "index": 56,
    "text": "Our Kitty Cat Surprise Box"
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "text": "matches my shirt."
  },
  {
    "index": 58,
    "text": "It even has little peekaboo kitties"
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "text": "with their birthday hats on."
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "text": "Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "text": "Do you think there's something special"
  },
  {
    "index": 62,
    "text": "in here for my birthday?"
  },
  {
    "index": 63,
    "text": "Let's open it and see."
  },
  {
    "index": 64,
    "text": "[gasps] Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 65,
    "text": "It's birthday kitty ears."
  },
  {
    "index": 66,
    "text": "And look!"
  },
  {
    "index": 67,
    "text": "The ears are little party hats."
  },
  {
    "index": 68,
    "text": "Hmm. I wonder what happens"
  },
  {
    "index": 69,
    "text": "when you pinch 'em?"
  },
  {
    "index": 70,
    "text": "-[kitty ears] Meow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 71,
    "text": "-Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 72,
    "text": "Now, that was party-riffic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 73,
    "text": "[gasps] Oh."
  },
  {
    "index": 74,
    "text": "And there's something else in here."
  },
  {
    "index": 75,
    "text": "It's a birthday card..."
  },
  {
    "index": 76,
    "text": "from the Gabby Cats."
  },
  {
    "index": 77,
    "text": "\"Happy Birthday, Gabby."
  },
  {
    "index": 78,
    "text": "We hope you like"
  },
  {
    "index": 79,
    "text": "the kitty ears we made for you.\""
  },
  {
    "index": 80,
    "text": "Aww!"
  },
  {
    "index": 81,
    "text": "\"You can wear them"
  },
  {
    "index": 82,
    "text": "to your birthday party in the Dollhouse."
  },
  {
    "index": 83,
    "text": "See you soon.\""
  },
  {
    "index": 84,
    "text": "[gasps] My birthday party"
  },
  {
    "index": 85,
    "text": "in the Dollhouse?"
  },
  {
    "index": 86,
    "text": "This is going to be cat-tastic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 87,
    "text": "You're gonna come to my party too, right?"
  },
  {
    "index": 88,
    "text": "-[inhales]"
  },
  {
    "index": 89,
    "text": "-[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 90,
    "text": "Yay! I was hoping you'd say that."
  },
  {
    "index": 91,
    "text": "Then it's time to get tiny."
  },
  {
    "index": 92,
    "text": "♪ A pinch on my left"
  },
  {
    "index": 93,
    "text": "Pinch, pinch on my right ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 94,
    "text": "♪ Grab Pandy's hand and hold on tight! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 95,
    "text": "I'm over here, in the kitchen."
  },
  {
    "index": 96,
    "text": "-[kitty ears] Meow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 97,
    "text": "-Come on in."
  },
  {
    "index": 98,
    "text": "Welcome to the Dollhouse."
  },
  {
    "index": 99,
    "text": "I've got my birthday outfit,"
  },
  {
    "index": 100,
    "text": "my birthday ears."
  },
  {
    "index": 101,
    "text": "Now all I need is..."
  },
  {
    "index": 102,
    "text": "[kitty ears] Meow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 103,
    "text": "...my birthday hair."
  },
  {
    "index": 104,
    "text": "What do you think, Pandy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 105,
    "text": "Hmm. Where is Pandy hiding this time?"
  },
  {
    "index": 106,
    "text": "[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 107,
    "text": "Happy Birthday hug attack!"
  },
  {
    "index": 108,
    "text": "[Gabby laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 109,
    "text": "Aww! Thanks, Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 110,
    "text": "A hug from you"
  },
  {
    "index": 111,
    "text": "is just what I wanted for my birthday."
  },
  {
    "index": 112,
    "text": "[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 113,
    "text": "Birthday party sprinkle hug!"
  },
  {
    "index": 114,
    "text": "My birthday just started,"
  },
  {
    "index": 115,
    "text": "and I already got"
  },
  {
    "index": 116,
    "text": "two meow-mazing birthday hugs."
  },
  {
    "index": 117,
    "text": "I bet you'll get a lot more"
  },
  {
    "index": 118,
    "text": "where those came from"
  },
  {
    "index": 119,
    "text": "at your big birthday party."
  },
  {
    "index": 120,
    "text": "-[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 121,
    "text": "-[in unison] Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 122,
    "text": "Did somebody say \"birthday party\"?"
  },
  {
    "index": 123,
    "text": "-[in unison] CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 124,
    "text": "-That's right."
  },
  {
    "index": 125,
    "text": "But today, you can call me..."
  },
  {
    "index": 126,
    "text": "Cat-tastic Party Planner CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 127,
    "text": "Because when it comes"
  },
  {
    "index": 128,
    "text": "to planning birthday parties,"
  },
  {
    "index": 129,
    "text": "nobody does it better."
  },
  {
    "index": 130,
    "text": "And that's why I, the CatRat,"
  },
  {
    "index": 131,
    "text": "would like to plan your party."
  },
  {
    "index": 132,
    "text": "What do you say, Gabby? Hmm?"
  },
  {
    "index": 133,
    "text": "Oh, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 134,
    "text": "I would love that."
  },
  {
    "index": 135,
    "text": "Cat-tastic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 136,
    "text": "Now, just tell me"
  },
  {
    "index": 137,
    "text": "what theme you want for your party,"
  },
  {
    "index": 138,
    "text": "and leave the rest to me."
  },
  {
    "index": 139,
    "text": "What kind of party do you want, Gabby?"
  },
  {
    "index": 140,
    "text": "Hmm. That's a tough one."
  },
  {
    "index": 141,
    "text": "There are so many good choices."
  },
  {
    "index": 142,
    "text": "Maybe you can get some ideas from my..."
  },
  {
    "index": 143,
    "text": "Big Book of Birthday Cakes."
  },
  {
    "index": 144,
    "text": "Sweet idea, Cakey. Let's take a look."
  },
  {
    "index": 145,
    "text": "Ooh! There's a robot cake."
  },
  {
    "index": 146,
    "text": "Perfect for a robot party."
  },
  {
    "index": 147,
    "text": "[Pandy] Or an under-the-sea cake"
  },
  {
    "index": 148,
    "text": "with Kitty Narwhal."
  },
  {
    "index": 149,
    "text": "[Gabby] Look! There's an outer space cake."
  },
  {
    "index": 150,
    "text": "[Pandy] Ooh! What about this one, Gabby?"
  },
  {
    "index": 151,
    "text": "You love hearts."
  },
  {
    "index": 152,
    "text": "They're my favorite shape. See?"
  },
  {
    "index": 153,
    "text": "Maybe you could have a heart party."
  },
  {
    "index": 154,
    "text": "I love that idea, Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 155,
    "text": "Let's do it."
  },
  {
    "index": 156,
    "text": "A heart party it is."
  },
  {
    "index": 157,
    "text": "I already have a cake in the oven"
  },
  {
    "index": 158,
    "text": "that I think will be just perfect."
  },
  {
    "index": 159,
    "text": "And I'll get started"
  },
  {
    "index": 160,
    "text": "on that big party surprise. [giggles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 161,
    "text": "Ooh! A surprise? Can we help?"
  },
  {
    "index": 162,
    "text": "Of course not."
  },
  {
    "index": 163,
    "text": "That would spoil the surprise, silly."
  },
  {
    "index": 164,
    "text": "See you at the party."
  },
  {
    "index": 165,
    "text": "[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 166,
    "text": "Cake's ready."
  },
  {
    "index": 167,
    "text": "Ah..."
  },
  {
    "index": 168,
    "text": "[sniffs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 169,
    "text": "Mm! Smells delicious."
  },
  {
    "index": 170,
    "text": "Yeah. But, Cakey, this isn't a heart cake."
  },
  {
    "index": 171,
    "text": "It's a square cake and a circle cake."
  },
  {
    "index": 172,
    "text": "It isn't a heart cake yet,"
  },
  {
    "index": 173,
    "text": "but we can use these shapes to make one."
  },
  {
    "index": 174,
    "text": "The first thing we need to do"
  },
  {
    "index": 175,
    "text": "is cut the circle in half."
  },
  {
    "index": 176,
    "text": "There. Now we can put these shapes"
  },
  {
    "index": 177,
    "text": "together to make a heart."
  },
  {
    "index": 178,
    "text": "-Can I try?"
  },
  {
    "index": 179,
    "text": "-Give it a go."
  },
  {
    "index": 180,
    "text": "[Pandy] Let's see."
  },
  {
    "index": 181,
    "text": "Put this here, this one here,"
  },
  {
    "index": 182,
    "text": "and this here."
  },
  {
    "index": 183,
    "text": "Does that make a heart?"
  },
  {
    "index": 184,
    "text": "No?"
  },
  {
    "index": 185,
    "text": "[sighs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 186,
    "text": "Give it another try, Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 187,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 188,
    "text": "What if we turn this piece like this,"
  },
  {
    "index": 189,
    "text": "put this piece here,"
  },
  {
    "index": 190,
    "text": "and this one right here?"
  },
  {
    "index": 191,
    "text": "[Cakey] You made a heart!"
  },
  {
    "index": 192,
    "text": "I knew you could do it."
  },
  {
    "index": 193,
    "text": "Now let's pick out some frosting."
  },
  {
    "index": 194,
    "text": "Do you like pink, Gabby?"
  },
  {
    "index": 195,
    "text": "Like it? I heart it."
  },
  {
    "index": 196,
    "text": "[giggles] Come on."
  },
  {
    "index": 197,
    "text": "Psst!"
  },
  {
    "index": 198,
    "text": "Hey. Guess what."
  },
  {
    "index": 199,
    "text": "Gabby's big birthday surprise is ready."
  },
  {
    "index": 200,
    "text": "Do you want to see it? Meet me outside."
  },
  {
    "index": 201,
    "text": "Yoo-hoo! I'm up here."
  },
  {
    "index": 202,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 203,
    "text": "Are you ready to see the big surprise?"
  },
  {
    "index": 204,
    "text": "Come on in."
  },
  {
    "index": 205,
    "text": "It's the Dollhouse party room."
  },
  {
    "index": 206,
    "text": "I decorated just for Gabby."
  },
  {
    "index": 207,
    "text": "Heart balloons."
  },
  {
    "index": 208,
    "text": "Heart decorations."
  },
  {
    "index": 209,
    "text": "Hearts, hearts, hearts!"
  },
  {
    "index": 210,
    "text": "Even a light-up floor covered in..."
  },
  {
    "index": 211,
    "text": "You guessed it."
  },
  {
    "index": 212,
    "text": "Hearts! [chuckles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 213,
    "text": "No one has ever seen this room before."
  },
  {
    "index": 214,
    "text": "Not even Gabby."
  },
  {
    "index": 215,
    "text": "She's gonna be so surprised. Mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 216,
    "text": "I can heart-ly wait"
  },
  {
    "index": 217,
    "text": "for her to see it. [chuckles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 218,
    "text": "But I bet you're wondering,"
  },
  {
    "index": 219,
    "text": "\"How did the CatRat do all this?\""
  },
  {
    "index": 220,
    "text": "Well, I'll show ya."
  },
  {
    "index": 221,
    "text": "Oh, Party Tail!"
  },
  {
    "index": 222,
    "text": "With just a swing of the Party Tail,"
  },
  {
    "index": 223,
    "text": "I can change the party room"
  },
  {
    "index": 224,
    "text": "to anything at all."
  },
  {
    "index": 225,
    "text": "You want a robot party? Beep-bop-boop!"
  },
  {
    "index": 226,
    "text": "Ha-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 227,
    "text": "Under-the-sea party?"
  },
  {
    "index": 228,
    "text": "Ha-cha! Hee-hee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 229,
    "text": "And if it's an outer space party"
  },
  {
    "index": 230,
    "text": "you're after..."
  },
  {
    "index": 231,
    "text": "Ha-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 232,
    "text": "Pretty cool, huh?"
  },
  {
    "index": 233,
    "text": "But since it's hearts Gabby wants,"
  },
  {
    "index": 234,
    "text": "it's hearts Gabby gets."
  },
  {
    "index": 235,
    "text": "Ha-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 236,
    "text": "[sighs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 237,
    "text": "My work here is done. [slurps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 238,
    "text": "Ta-da!"
  },
  {
    "index": 239,
    "text": "Sprinkle-riffic job, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 240,
    "text": "It's what I do. [giggles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 241,
    "text": "-[phone ringing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 242,
    "text": "-Oh! I'm getting a call."
  },
  {
    "index": 243,
    "text": "MerCat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 244,
    "text": "Happy Birthday, Gabby-Gabby!"
  },
  {
    "index": 245,
    "text": "How's your special day going?"
  },
  {
    "index": 246,
    "text": "It's going cat-tastic, MerCat."
  },
  {
    "index": 247,
    "text": "We just finished decorating the cake."
  },
  {
    "index": 248,
    "text": "She's having a heart party."
  },
  {
    "index": 249,
    "text": "Shimmering sea scales!"
  },
  {
    "index": 250,
    "text": "That gives me a mer-mazing idea."
  },
  {
    "index": 251,
    "text": "Come on up to the bathroom"
  },
  {
    "index": 252,
    "text": "for your bubbly birthday surprise."
  },
  {
    "index": 253,
    "text": "-See you soon."
  },
  {
    "index": 254,
    "text": "-[phones chimes]"
  },
  {
    "index": 255,
    "text": "Eee! This birthday"
  },
  {
    "index": 256,
    "text": "keeps getting better and better!"
  },
  {
    "index": 257,
    "text": "To the bathroom!"
  },
  {
    "index": 258,
    "text": "Thanks, Cakey. See you at the party."
  },
  {
    "index": 259,
    "text": "I'll bring the cake."
  },
  {
    "index": 260,
    "text": "[Cat-A-Vator bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 261,
    "text": "Hey, MerCat."
  },
  {
    "index": 262,
    "text": "There's my birthday girl."
  },
  {
    "index": 263,
    "text": "Feast your eyes"
  },
  {
    "index": 264,
    "text": "on your very own heart-themed bubble bath."
  },
  {
    "index": 265,
    "text": "[in unison] Arrg!"
  },
  {
    "index": 266,
    "text": "Uh, MerCat..."
  },
  {
    "index": 267,
    "text": "I'm not seeing any hearts in there."
  },
  {
    "index": 268,
    "text": "Oh, my! I think"
  },
  {
    "index": 269,
    "text": "we got our fins crossed on this one."
  },
  {
    "index": 270,
    "text": "[in unison] Whoopsie!"
  },
  {
    "index": 271,
    "text": "Well, who doesn't love"
  },
  {
    "index": 272,
    "text": "a good pirate party?"
  },
  {
    "index": 273,
    "text": "[kitty ears] Meow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 274,
    "text": "I'm coming in."
  },
  {
    "index": 275,
    "text": "[in unison] Arrg!"
  },
  {
    "index": 276,
    "text": "♪ Yes, arrg! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 277,
    "text": "♪ Yo-ho! We're givin' it a go ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 278,
    "text": "♪ Our tails are scallywaggin' now"
  },
  {
    "index": 279,
    "text": "Me hearties ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 280,
    "text": "♪ A-harr! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 281,
    "text": "♪ Ye bubbles in the bath"
  },
  {
    "index": 282,
    "text": "Will make our mate relax ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 283,
    "text": "♪ Before she goes ashore"
  },
  {
    "index": 284,
    "text": "And birthday-parties ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 285,
    "text": "♪ A birthday spa ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 286,
    "text": "♪ The jolly kitty pirate way ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 287,
    "text": "♪ We lather, we rinse, and repeat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 288,
    "text": "♪ We're polishing your nails ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 289,
    "text": "♪ We're hoisting up your sails ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 290,
    "text": "Arrg!"
  },
  {
    "index": 291,
    "text": "♪ Arrg! Yo-ho! It isn't hearts, I know ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 292,
    "text": "♪ But I reckon"
  },
  {
    "index": 293,
    "text": "A pirate theme ain't too shabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 294,
    "text": "♪ So glad we gave it a shot"
  },
  {
    "index": 295,
    "text": "Like X, we marked the spot ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 296,
    "text": "♪ Happy Birthday, Gabby! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 297,
    "text": "♪ Arr! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 298,
    "text": "Maybe I should"
  },
  {
    "index": 299,
    "text": "have a pirate party this year."
  },
  {
    "index": 300,
    "text": "Let me just give CatRat a call"
  },
  {
    "index": 301,
    "text": "to let him know."
  },
  {
    "index": 302,
    "text": "[phone chiming]"
  },
  {
    "index": 303,
    "text": "Yello!"
  },
  {
    "index": 304,
    "text": "CatRat the Cat-tastic Party Planner here."
  },
  {
    "index": 305,
    "text": "Hey, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 306,
    "text": "There's been a change of plans."
  },
  {
    "index": 307,
    "text": "Do you think you could switch"
  },
  {
    "index": 308,
    "text": "Gabby's heart party to a pirate party?"
  },
  {
    "index": 309,
    "text": "Pirates?!"
  },
  {
    "index": 310,
    "text": "Aww! But I just got"
  },
  {
    "index": 311,
    "text": "the whole heart thing set up."
  },
  {
    "index": 312,
    "text": "Please, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 313,
    "text": "Gabby would really love it."
  },
  {
    "index": 314,
    "text": "[sighs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 315,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 316,
    "text": "If it's pirates Gabby wants,"
  },
  {
    "index": 317,
    "text": "then pirates she will have."
  },
  {
    "index": 318,
    "text": "Thanks, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 319,
    "text": "[phone chimes]"
  },
  {
    "index": 320,
    "text": "Oh, Party Tail!"
  },
  {
    "index": 321,
    "text": "We gotta get this pirate party swingin'."
  },
  {
    "index": 322,
    "text": "-Ha-char!"
  },
  {
    "index": 323,
    "text": "-[ship bell clangs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 324,
    "text": "-Oh, yeah!"
  },
  {
    "index": 325,
    "text": "-[seagulls squawking]"
  },
  {
    "index": 326,
    "text": "Gabby's gonna love this."
  },
  {
    "index": 327,
    "text": "[sighs] Now my work is done."
  },
  {
    "index": 328,
    "text": "[giggles, slurps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 329,
    "text": "Pirate party is all set."
  },
  {
    "index": 330,
    "text": "Thanks, Pandy. This birthday"
  },
  {
    "index": 331,
    "text": "just keeps getting better and better."
  },
  {
    "index": 332,
    "text": "[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 333,
    "text": "Happy Birthday, Gabby!"
  },
  {
    "index": 334,
    "text": "Hi, Kitty Fairy."
  },
  {
    "index": 335,
    "text": "I have a flower-riffic birthday surprise"
  },
  {
    "index": 336,
    "text": "for you in the Fairy Tail Garden."
  },
  {
    "index": 337,
    "text": "Ooh! The birthday surprises"
  },
  {
    "index": 338,
    "text": "just keep coming!"
  },
  {
    "index": 339,
    "text": "Wow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 340,
    "text": "Are you ready to fly?"
  },
  {
    "index": 341,
    "text": "Lead the way, Kitty Fairy."
  },
  {
    "index": 342,
    "text": "Follow me!"
  },
  {
    "index": 343,
    "text": "Thanks so much"
  },
  {
    "index": 344,
    "text": "for the jolly good bubble bath."
  },
  {
    "index": 345,
    "text": "-See you at the party."
  },
  {
    "index": 346,
    "text": "-Arrg!"
  },
  {
    "index": 347,
    "text": "[Gabby gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 348,
    "text": "Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 349,
    "text": "Welcome to your Flower Safari!"
  },
  {
    "index": 350,
    "text": "-Zee-hee-hee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 351,
    "text": "-Roar!"
  },
  {
    "index": 352,
    "text": "-[nasal bellowing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 353,
    "text": "-Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ooh-ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 354,
    "text": "Whoa! Those flowers"
  },
  {
    "index": 355,
    "text": "sound like a bunch of wild animals."
  },
  {
    "index": 356,
    "text": "These are Safari Flowers."
  },
  {
    "index": 357,
    "text": "And the best part is,"
  },
  {
    "index": 358,
    "text": "if we put them in just the right order,"
  },
  {
    "index": 359,
    "text": "they sing us a Flower Safari song."
  },
  {
    "index": 360,
    "text": "Get ready to listen."
  },
  {
    "index": 361,
    "text": "The first flower we're looking for"
  },
  {
    "index": 362,
    "text": "sounds like this."
  },
  {
    "index": 363,
    "text": "[Safari Flower] Roar-roar! Roar!"
  },
  {
    "index": 364,
    "text": "Which flowers make the sound we need?"
  },
  {
    "index": 365,
    "text": "Ooh-ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 366,
    "text": "[nasal bellowing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 367,
    "text": "Zip-zee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 368,
    "text": "Roar-roar! Roar!"
  },
  {
    "index": 369,
    "text": "Roar-roar!"
  },
  {
    "index": 370,
    "text": "A Tiger Blossom."
  },
  {
    "index": 371,
    "text": "What's the next flower, Kitty Fairy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 372,
    "text": "The next flower sounds like this."
  },
  {
    "index": 373,
    "text": "[Safari Flower bellows nasally]"
  },
  {
    "index": 374,
    "text": "Which flowers make that sound?"
  },
  {
    "index": 375,
    "text": "Zip-zee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 376,
    "text": "Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 377,
    "text": "[nasal bellowing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 378,
    "text": "[bellows]"
  },
  {
    "index": 379,
    "text": "[Pandy] An Elephant Flower."
  },
  {
    "index": 380,
    "text": "-[sniffs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 381,
    "text": "-[bellows]"
  },
  {
    "index": 382,
    "text": "[laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 383,
    "text": "The next flower sounds like this."
  },
  {
    "index": 384,
    "text": "[Safari Flower] Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 385,
    "text": "[Gabby] Which one makes that sound?"
  },
  {
    "index": 386,
    "text": "Zip-zee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 387,
    "text": "Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 388,
    "text": "Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 389,
    "text": "-Hello, little Monkey Flower."
  },
  {
    "index": 390,
    "text": "-Ooh-ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 391,
    "text": "And last, but not least..."
  },
  {
    "index": 392,
    "text": "Zip-zee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 393,
    "text": "...a Zebra Zinnia!"
  },
  {
    "index": 394,
    "text": "We did it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 395,
    "text": "Now, let's hear that song."
  },
  {
    "index": 396,
    "text": "[groovy music playing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 397,
    "text": "-♪ Ooh-ooh! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 398,
    "text": "-♪ Zip-zee! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 399,
    "text": "-♪ Roar! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 400,
    "text": "-[rhythmic nasal bellowing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 401,
    "text": "-♪ Roar! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 402,
    "text": "-♪ Ooh-ooh! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 403,
    "text": "♪ Zip-zee! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 404,
    "text": "[rhythmic nasal bellowing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 405,
    "text": "-♪ Zip-zee! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 406,
    "text": "-♪ Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ooh! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 407,
    "text": "[Gabby chuckles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 408,
    "text": "Don't you just love safaris?"
  },
  {
    "index": 409,
    "text": "You always see something a-meow-zing."
  },
  {
    "index": 410,
    "text": "Hey, I have a wild idea."
  },
  {
    "index": 411,
    "text": "What if you had a safari party?"
  },
  {
    "index": 412,
    "text": "Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 413,
    "text": "-Zip-zee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 414,
    "text": "-Roar!"
  },
  {
    "index": 415,
    "text": "Ooh-ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 416,
    "text": "I like the sound of that."
  },
  {
    "index": 417,
    "text": "Great!"
  },
  {
    "index": 418,
    "text": "Let me just give CatRat another call."
  },
  {
    "index": 419,
    "text": "-[phone chiming]"
  },
  {
    "index": 420,
    "text": "-[slurps, sighs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 421,
    "text": "Ahoy there, Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 422,
    "text": "Hey, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 423,
    "text": "Listen, we've got"
  },
  {
    "index": 424,
    "text": "one more teeny-tiny change for ya."
  },
  {
    "index": 425,
    "text": "Aww! What now?"
  },
  {
    "index": 426,
    "text": "How do you feel about a safari party?"
  },
  {
    "index": 427,
    "text": "A safari party?"
  },
  {
    "index": 428,
    "text": "[CatRat sighs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 429,
    "text": "Well, if it makes Gabby happy,"
  },
  {
    "index": 430,
    "text": "then a safari party it is."
  },
  {
    "index": 431,
    "text": "-Thanks, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 432,
    "text": "-[phone chimes]"
  },
  {
    "index": 433,
    "text": "Here we go again."
  },
  {
    "index": 434,
    "text": "Oh, Party Tail!"
  },
  {
    "index": 435,
    "text": "-Ha-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 436,
    "text": "-[elephant bellows]"
  },
  {
    "index": 437,
    "text": "Hey. This safari theme really brings"
  },
  {
    "index": 438,
    "text": "the whole room together, don't you think?"
  },
  {
    "index": 439,
    "text": "Oh! I better call everyone up here"
  },
  {
    "index": 440,
    "text": "before Pandy gets any more ideas."
  },
  {
    "index": 441,
    "text": "-[megaphone whines]"
  },
  {
    "index": 442,
    "text": "-Guess what, Gabby Cats!"
  },
  {
    "index": 443,
    "text": "It's birthday party time!"
  },
  {
    "index": 444,
    "text": "It's party time!"
  },
  {
    "index": 445,
    "text": "Eee! Let's go!"
  },
  {
    "index": 446,
    "text": "[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 447,
    "text": "All aboard for your big surprise."
  },
  {
    "index": 448,
    "text": "[Cat-A-Vator bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 449,
    "text": "[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 450,
    "text": "Happy Birthday, Gabby!"
  },
  {
    "index": 451,
    "text": "I've got the cake."
  },
  {
    "index": 452,
    "text": "[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 453,
    "text": "[in unison] Happy Birthday, Gabby!"
  },
  {
    "index": 454,
    "text": "[Gabby laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 455,
    "text": "[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 456,
    "text": "This is so exciting!"
  },
  {
    "index": 457,
    "text": "Happy Birthday, Gabby! Beep-beep!"
  },
  {
    "index": 458,
    "text": "Thanks, everybody."
  },
  {
    "index": 459,
    "text": "Uh, CatRat, we've stopped"
  },
  {
    "index": 460,
    "text": "on every floor in the Dollhouse."
  },
  {
    "index": 461,
    "text": "-Where's the party happening?"
  },
  {
    "index": 462,
    "text": "-That is your big birthday surprise."
  },
  {
    "index": 463,
    "text": "Cat-A-Vator, to the party room!"
  },
  {
    "index": 464,
    "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
    "index": 465,
    "text": "[party music playing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 466,
    "text": "-[fireworks crackling]"
  },
  {
    "index": 467,
    "text": "-[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 468,
    "text": "Happy Birthday, Gabby!"
  },
  {
    "index": 469,
    "text": "[gasps] Thanks, Cat-A-Vator."
  },
  {
    "index": 470,
    "text": "-[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 471,
    "text": "-[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 472,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 473,
    "text": "A-meow-zing!"
  },
  {
    "index": 474,
    "text": "-Doodles and doodads!"
  },
  {
    "index": 475,
    "text": "-Wow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 476,
    "text": "-You gotta be kitten me!"
  },
  {
    "index": 477,
    "text": "-[Gabby laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 478,
    "text": "Surprise!"
  },
  {
    "index": 479,
    "text": "What is this place?"
  },
  {
    "index": 480,
    "text": "It's your new party room."
  },
  {
    "index": 481,
    "text": "-Do you like it?"
  },
  {
    "index": 482,
    "text": "-Like it?"
  },
  {
    "index": 483,
    "text": "I love it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 484,
    "text": "And I love all the safari stuff."
  },
  {
    "index": 485,
    "text": "The balloons,"
  },
  {
    "index": 486,
    "text": "the decorations,"
  },
  {
    "index": 487,
    "text": "the lights."
  },
  {
    "index": 488,
    "text": "It's a-meow-zing, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 489,
    "text": "You did all this just for me?"
  },
  {
    "index": 490,
    "text": "Yeah, well, it took a little work."
  },
  {
    "index": 491,
    "text": "But I just wanted to make sure"
  },
  {
    "index": 492,
    "text": "your birthday was as special as you are."
  },
  {
    "index": 493,
    "text": "Aww! I love you, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 494,
    "text": "And you really are"
  },
  {
    "index": 495,
    "text": "the best party planner ever."
  },
  {
    "index": 496,
    "text": "What can I say?"
  },
  {
    "index": 497,
    "text": "I have a talent, among many."
  },
  {
    "index": 498,
    "text": "Oh! And I have something else"
  },
  {
    "index": 499,
    "text": "to show you too."
  },
  {
    "index": 500,
    "text": "Oh, Party Tail!"
  },
  {
    "index": 501,
    "text": "[Gabby gasps, laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 502,
    "text": "I know you had a lot of great ideas"
  },
  {
    "index": 503,
    "text": "about what kind of party you wanted,"
  },
  {
    "index": 504,
    "text": "so I decided, why not have 'em all?"
  },
  {
    "index": 505,
    "text": "Ha-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 506,
    "text": "[Pandy] Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 507,
    "text": "[Baby Box gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 508,
    "text": "Whoa! A heart party!"
  },
  {
    "index": 509,
    "text": "Huh? Give it a whirl."
  },
  {
    "index": 510,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 511,
    "text": "Pirates!"
  },
  {
    "index": 512,
    "text": "-[pirate music playing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 513,
    "text": "-[ship bell clangs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 514,
    "text": "Arrg! Happy Birthday, Gabby!"
  },
  {
    "index": 515,
    "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 516,
    "text": "Whoa-ho-ho!"
  },
  {
    "index": 517,
    "text": "Looks like"
  },
  {
    "index": 518,
    "text": "you've got some party-planning skills too."
  },
  {
    "index": 519,
    "text": "Listen up, Gabby Cats."
  },
  {
    "index": 520,
    "text": "Now, I hope"
  },
  {
    "index": 521,
    "text": "you've got your roller skates on,"
  },
  {
    "index": 522,
    "text": "'cause this tune's going out to the..."
  },
  {
    "index": 523,
    "text": "[mimics klaxon blaring] ...birthday girl!"
  },
  {
    "index": 524,
    "text": "♪ Happy Birthday, dear Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 525,
    "text": "♪ We're making sure"
  },
  {
    "index": 526,
    "text": "That your day is happy as can be ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 527,
    "text": "[groaning]"
  },
  {
    "index": 528,
    "text": "-♪ You'll see ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 529,
    "text": "-[laughter]"
  },
  {
    "index": 530,
    "text": "♪ Come on! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 531,
    "text": "-♪ Swing the tail and change the theme ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 532,
    "text": "-♪ Whoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 533,
    "text": "-♪ Robots, hearts, under the sea ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 534,
    "text": "-♪ Whoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 535,
    "text": "♪ We're here to cheer"
  },
  {
    "index": 536,
    "text": "For the birthday girl ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 537,
    "text": "♪ To throw the best party in the world ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 538,
    "text": "-♪ Happy Birthday, dear Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 539,
    "text": "-[Gabby laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 540,
    "text": "♪ We're making sure"
  },
  {
    "index": 541,
    "text": "That your day is happy as can be ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 542,
    "text": "Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 543,
    "text": "♪ You'll see ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 544,
    "text": "♪ Your friends are here to say surprise! ♪"
  },
  {
